  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Workshop i Logical Framework Approach (LFA) f&#xf6;r Novgorodsatsningen 1999-2002. Genom bearbetning av problemformuleringar, m&#xe5;l och resultat i enligthet med LFA-modellen, kommer seminariet utmynna i en konkret projektmatris som visualiserar de inriktningar och insatser projektet b&#xf6;r intaga. Svensk part &#xe4;r SPM Consultants KB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop on Logical Framework Approach (LFA). The workshop is expected to lay the contextual foundation for the development of a set of concrete project proposals and documents to be elaborated by a Swedish project manager in cooperation with Russian Counterparts. Swedish counteraprt is SPM Consultants KB.</narrative>
  </description>
